 "verdict": "CONTROL: the exact-zero CRN null holds at 6/6 checkpoints. Identical twins never diverge on the binary lattice, so the coupling certification carries over to this construction. COHORT: cohort intact: all 6 declared checkpoints measured FIXED-POINT CHECK (the registered live kill, and it is read from the SETTLED STATE so it does not require damage to ignite): mean dominant-token share on the binary ring is 0.978. The lattice is FROZEN. Restricting to a two-token in-distribution support does NOT escape the degeneracy -- it manufactures its own, reproducing F62/F66 one level down. So F41's coupling caveat cannot be removed by this construction: there is no live damage regime at this temperature to measure in. AND DAMAGE NEVER IGNITES (mean ignition 0.000): the injected block coalesces to exactly zero within a few sweeps, so lambda_ca is UNDEFINED here by F42 and no exponent is reported. The measured trajectory decays monotonically from injection -- it does not rise and then die -- which is healing winning outright, not a subcritical spread. No ignited runs, so no lambda statistics are computed (F42). BOUNDARY: this is a RUNG. It shows the coupling caveat can be removed by construction; it says nothing about the full-vocabulary numbers, and must not be quoted as one.",
